  "raw_result": "\n\nChatGPT is a model from OpenAI that is fine-tuned to generate human-like responses to text-based inputs. It is a type of artificial intelligence (AI) that uses deep learning to understand and respond to a wide range of prompts, making it useful for tasks such as answering questions, carrying out conversations, and providing information. ChatGPT is designed to mimic the conversational style of a human, and it can be used in various applications, such as customer service, education, and entertainment.",
  "result": "什么是ChatGPT？\n\nChatGPT 是一种基于人工智能的对话机器人，可以与用户进行自然语言对话，并提供相应的回答。它是由微软研究院开发的，目前已经被广泛应用于各种场景中，如客服、教育、娱乐等。"
